# Project-created (no upstream Kconfig: on sm8550 this builds via Bazel/Kleaf).
# Symbol name matches the upstream Makefile (obj-$(CONFIG_MAPPED_PROTECT)).
# Deliberately WITHOUT the upstream CONFIG_MAPPED_PROTECT_ALL variant
# (page_mapcount()-based branches): the atomic _mapcount path compiled
# here is guaranteed 5.15-safe.
config MAPPED_PROTECT
	tristate "oplus mapped-file reclaim protection"
	default n
	help
	  Protect frequently-mapped file pages from reclaim via mm vendor
	  hooks. Load as a module.
